<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-11-03T09:46:53.115Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:46:53 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States carried out limited strikes on Iran’s Qeshm Island while Iran announced it would reopen the Strait of Hormuz within two days as part of a U.S. deal. Tehran continued negotiations with Qatari mediators and U.S. officials, and President Trump said a deal could happen and urged faster cease-fire talks. Israeli officials called for new strikes on Iran, and Gulf Arab states voiced concern over the war cloud. The conflict remains active with both sides exchanging threats and limited strikes, and 123 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/nov/02/oil-price-falls-amid-hope-of-a-breakthrough-to-end-iran-war&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNNDZMeXJRb2V1VTZBSkg2YjJNUXhEMkZJMkZtUkNGMTJoOGZwUkptWTdVR1N4QUVSYTY4QnZ1ZFpodFFweTZGSlFUbkNxZWlSNUJKeHdMYmo4aDVSVTZMLVJwNXROeUVxcWVtYUlhV1Nib3hTRUo2RmZRUkZhUnBDZXZYSVRoVGd3VG5tZmpiZmRYSms1?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxQZEVsamV1YUVMeGVWelE0anFHUGpYeGVrX1FhR0U3VDR6ODlvUGJHcVN0LUxpN1JSeDF3Zmt3U1pHU1dTX0p2THlObzhPeEQ3anlBNjB5U2d3Um9sbFRvLXJoSFlQajR3aXVucnFkNDFaQU1qdzU1aEt6WFZlSEl6bGN0UW5aMkhKXzNWRERvS3BzOEI5Mk14ekNOdnU0LW90YS1wNVpqanpfSHJCQmRxZVg1dENLdEpzYXFwYXZYZ3g?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/03/us-strikes-irans-qeshm-island&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOakQ2dHpWeVF0SFVPOHZaLUtaYWV5YzNycVlYNU1JQlRxRFF3X0xjM2k0dndPNlg5VWcxOHJ2S1h6VldqejlGZjAwSEhfbDVxN2xRbUVGNW4xdU51bTNnZkJZN0JNLVo3MkVFdy0tUFVQSGFrZ0t6aG5VQ1F0WTEyUDlMczZTN3d5Z1Z0dk5XWkFSM